WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.149 --> 00:00:06.500
If you were the main protagonist of one piece,
what are the 3 best devil fruits you needed

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.320
to change the world?

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.590
And I mean from start to finish.

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:14.929
Not only defeating Black beard and the world
government, but turning the world into a better

00:00:14.929 --> 00:00:16.660
place for everyone?

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.330
This is how you do it.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.679
What is the most powerful devil fruit there
is?

00:00:22.679 --> 00:00:28.119
That's a question that has been asked by a
lot of people, and the answer usually is some

00:00:28.119 --> 00:00:34.520
variation of a top 10 list, that contains
pretty much the same fruits every time with

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:39.650
an unexpected fruit thrown in there for some
novelty.

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:43.180
I'm honestly a bit tired of the format.

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:49.320
And yes you clicked on my thumbnail, cause
it's a pretty good one, but you probably are

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:52.530
dreading the same repetitive video as well.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:57.230
So for the sake of all our sanities, instead
of looking at individual fruits and giving

00:00:57.230 --> 00:01:02.190
my opinion on how much boom boom each of these
does, I want to look at devil fruits from

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:07.860
a perspective I've always found leagues more
fascinating to think about anyway: What are

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:12.960
the best devil fruits, when they have the
chance to be used together in a strategic

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:15.890
way to achieve a greater goal?

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:20.470
And I'm not only talking about battle here,
I think very different devil fruits become

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:28.280
incredibly powerful depending on the context
you want to use them in.

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:37.340
And I thought to myself: How could I change
the world faster than Luffy?

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:39.270
What would I need to do?

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:46.920
So, I sat down with pen and paper and a big
can of coffee and started brainstorming.

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:51.670
And in the end, I managed to worked out 5
foolproof steps in which the right combination

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:55.000
of devil fruits will be an absolute game changer.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:00.640
And to make it more interesting, since devil
fruits are hard to come by, I will limit myself

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:02.660
to 3 devil fruits per step.

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:05.060
Okay so close your eyes for a second.

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:10.659
I want you to imagine that you are the protagonist
of One Piece, you have all the knowledge about

00:02:10.659 --> 00:02:15.579
this world, that you currently have and it's
your destiny to save this world and lead it

00:02:15.579 --> 00:02:17.180
into a better future.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:20.889
You and a handful of Nakama.

00:02:20.889 --> 00:02:22.590
What do you have to do?

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:28.799
The goal will be to take down the world government,
defeat Blackbeard and create a peaceful and

00:02:28.799 --> 00:02:35.450
prosperous world.

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:38.819
Well first of all, there is the issue that
we need to get our hands on the devil fruits

00:02:38.819 --> 00:02:43.180
we need and the poneglyphs on top to find
laugh tale.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:48.360
The first of our five categories therefore
will be a science slash information gathering

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:49.360
squad.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:54.950
The best devil fruit to start out with here
I think is viola's Giro Giro no mi, hat allows

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:57.919
the user to see through everything.

00:02:57.919 --> 00:03:01.709
With this, we can look anywhere for anything
we want.

00:03:01.709 --> 00:03:04.370
Check if there is a devil fruit on board of
that ship over there?

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:05.370
No problem.

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:08.079
Check if there is a treasure at the bottom
of the sea here?

00:03:08.079 --> 00:03:09.090
No problem.

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:12.469
Or even check if there is a poneglyph around
somewhere.

00:03:12.469 --> 00:03:17.010
You could also use it to scout, to spy and
to avoid traps of any sort.

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:26.819
Oh and did I mention that it can read minds?

00:03:26.819 --> 00:03:31.519
With this fruit you can locate all resources
you will need on this journey.

00:03:31.519 --> 00:03:34.430
Money, Devil fruits, Information.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:35.430
Anything.

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:40.449
The only problem is that you might not be
able to do much about it, even if you found

00:03:40.449 --> 00:03:41.859
a lot of things.

00:03:41.859 --> 00:03:43.680
This is where the other two fruits come in.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:50.260
The OP Op no mi, quite well-named I have to
admit, as well as mont dor's Boku Boku no

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:51.260
mi.

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:57.209
This devil fruit not only comes with it's
own little pocket dimension, but you can also

00:03:57.209 --> 00:04:01.329
store anything and everything inside books.

00:04:01.329 --> 00:04:05.909
Including living things.

00:04:05.909 --> 00:04:14.309
So all the treasure and resources you find
could be stored inside inside books without

00:04:14.309 --> 00:04:17.200
having to worry about ever running out of
space.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:27.220
Plus you can even use this ability to build
a communication network.

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:32.319
All this is then perfected by the OP Op no
mI's room ability, that allows you to simply

00:04:32.319 --> 00:04:37.620
switch out the item you want and directly
store it in a book.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:43.690
So you could scout a Devil fruit in a chest
on a marine ship and simply use the op op

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:49.389
no mi to transport it right onto your ship
Without the marines ever suspecting anything

00:04:49.389 --> 00:04:53.060
from another ship far in the distance.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:57.900
So this step is our ultimate base on which
we can build now.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:03.509
You have free access to all information and
resources you could ever want.

00:05:03.509 --> 00:05:08.850
The next thing we need is the ability to move
freely wherever we go, topple pirate crews

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:15.110
and corrupt governments and get rid of antagonists
that are too strong for us to face yet.

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:21.680
For this political slash infiltration team,
our One Piece CIA of sorts, we can first of

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:23.990
all reuse the OP OP no mi.

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:29.820
Not only can we get in and out very quickly,
but in case you've forgotten, this devil fruit

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:46.650
has the ability to switch personalities.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:53.229
So you can easily restrict your crew member,
then change his personality with someone of

00:05:53.229 --> 00:05:54.710
your enemies side.

00:05:54.710 --> 00:06:00.240
With this you could infiltrate easily or if
you want to go really dark, manipulate people

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:03.190
to get to their devil fruits.

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:05.470
If you know what I mean.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:10.879
As if this weren't powerful enough yet, I
would add sugars Hobby fruit as well as absaloms

00:06:10.879 --> 00:06:18.469
Suke Suke no mi to the mix.

00:06:18.469 --> 00:06:23.240
With that you can make a number of people
invisible to get to places unseen or simply

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:25.160
spy and observe.

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:30.240
And with sugars fruit, phew you know in a
way it's the spookiest ability in all of one

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:31.240
piece.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:38.330
You could literally be invisible, or switch
body with king and simply touch kaido and

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:45.990
suddenly no-one remembers that there ever
was a YOnko named kaido.

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:53.539
And the toy kaido would now have to obey your
every order.

00:06:53.539 --> 00:06:57.840
Really spooky thought, but definitely effective.

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:03.590
So now, we actually have the means to get
close to pretty much anyone, topple countries

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:06.650
and erase enemies from memory.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:09.190
Even still, this might not be enough yet.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:14.300
While in theory you could try and take out
Im or Blackbeard that way, we have to assume

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:19.409
that these groups are powerful enough themselves
to deal with such a sneak attack.

00:07:19.409 --> 00:07:23.900
So now, that you can gather all the resources
you need, might as well go to Laugh tale,

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:24.900
learn the true history.

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:30.950
And oh boy, you cant share what was on laugh
tale, but now you're really pumped to change

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:31.950
the world.

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:36.330
So now, we're going for the big guns.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:39.979
By the way, if you're enjoying this, let me
know if you'd like to see a version where

00:07:39.979 --> 00:07:45.719
I only get to use 1 fruit in total at the
start and everything is just as in the story.

00:07:45.719 --> 00:07:48.490
That might be fun to figure out as well.

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:51.960
SO make sure to subscribe for that.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:53.910
Step 3: Build an army.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:59.449
Now we're getting to the boom part.

00:07:59.449 --> 00:08:15.979
And I personally think that's a lot more enjoyable
to think about now.

00:08:15.979 --> 00:08:19.360
One thing we can do now of course is start
building an army.

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:24.800
Sadly, you're not Luffy and don't have his
special ability to bring people to his side.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:27.220
SO we have to make due with what we have.

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:31.520
By liberating countries we can get their soldiers
to join us.

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:38.760
And by turning other pirate captains into
toys, we can then stroll by and recruit their

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:40.310
men to our cause.

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:45.160
And maybe even share some crucial information
with the revolutionaries to have them in as

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:46.160
well.

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:55.510
Maybe cause some internal conflict within
the marines too, just in case.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:09:01.150
noice.

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:07.120
So now, that you have your army, the first
thing we want of course is a big boom boom

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:12.980
machine, and that right now to me can be none
other than Kaido's Uo Uo no mi.

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:16.830
If it isn't an actual ancient weapon, it might
as well be one.

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:24.270
I mean come on.

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:30.750
[] With this you can deal a lot of wide area
damage, create storms, make things float and

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:35.930
except to people with strong Conquerors haki
your practically invincible.

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:39.180
That's some great choice for some decent dps.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:44.560
And compared to the gura gura no mi, you don't
risk dealing collateral damage to half your

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:45.830
men as well.

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:56.890
Looking back at Marineford, that was really
a wild ride with Whitebeards power.[]

00:09:56.890 --> 00:10:01.270
Instead of going for more fire power here,
I would balance the Dragon with Mancheries

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:06.231
Heal Heal fruit, which is able to affect a
large number of people is an essential part

00:10:06.231 --> 00:10:12.020
to stay a strong and prepared force, even
during battle, as well as with Bartolomeos

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:19.430
Bari Bari no mi.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:24.620
That may be a bit of an odd choice, but not
only can you use it to block enemy attacks

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:29.010
of any sort, but you can also shield your
own army at the beginning while launching

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:30.430
a wide area attack.

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:35.130
At the same time, it can be used to make a
path for your troops up a wall or a mountain

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:39.570
or even shield someone until they're in the
middle of the enemy.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:44.850
And of course, some of the previous devil
fruits we've gathered will be just as useful.

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:50.780
For example, you can use the OP OP no mi to
transport troops quickly or destroy enemy

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:51.780
ships.

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:57.270
With this absolutely ridiculous force, it
should be easy to defeat even the likes of

00:10:57.270 --> 00:10:59.220
Blackbeard, Akainu and Imu.

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:04.740
Using a mix of military and political strategy
to bring down the system that has plagued

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:06.740
the one piece world for centuries.

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:13.560
Now however, it will also be your responsibility
to make sure the world becomes a better place

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:16.390
and doesn't sink into more chaos.

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:21.220
You already have the means to secure political
power for now and keep others trying to take

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:24.390
advantage of the situation at bay.

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:29.820
The best way to unite the people of the world,
is to actually have a landmass where people

00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:31.980
can live together in piece.

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:34.830
After all the one pice world is 99% water.

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:41.310
In case you're wondering, new landmasses are
created by volcanic eruptions underwater,

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:45.670
like this new island that was formed just
a few years ago on the canaries.

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:49.180
A really spectacular and impressive process
I think.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:12:00.270
And luckily there is a devil fruit out there
that is just perfect for this.

00:12:00.270 --> 00:12:05.170
With the help of Akainu's Manu Manu no mi,
you could create landmasses throughout the

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:10.360
one piece world, connect islands and widening
existing land masses.

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:15.760
The poor person with that fruit would have
to work for quite a while, but maybe akainu

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:24.510
himself might be the right candidate to deal
with his anger issues.

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:30.240
Once the magma has solidified, aided by storms
created by our usefull little dragon, an incredibly

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:35.250
powerful fruit to have will be Pika's Ishi
Ishi no mi.

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:41.160
With its help, instead of getting small balls
by abusing steroids, you could actually shape

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:50.300
entire islands into cities with walls, buildings
and infrastructure for people to use.

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:58.360
Heck, you could change the geography in such
a way, to create the perfect climatic conditions

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:03.240
for agriculture, forming huge terraces with
rivers flowing from the mountains.

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:09.870
You could shield cities from floods and create
the optimal conditions for new countries to

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:10.870
flourish.

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:15.620
Honestly, this is such an overpowered and
useful fruit.

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:21.550
Pica and Sugar really did the worst things
possible with their abilities.

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:31.080
So now that we have free housing, free infrastructure
and can shape our terrain whatever way we

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:37.690
want, the last problem we face here, is that
everything is still very, well, no pun intended,

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:38.690
rocky.

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:44.380
Yes, volcanic grounds are fertile, but it
would take forever to get vegetation everywhere.

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:50.040
And so the third fruit you should use to solve
that problem is none other than Streusen's

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:53.079
Kiku Kiku no mi.

00:13:53.079 --> 00:14:02.190
[] That might sound weird at first, but think
about it.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:07.450
This fruit is as ridiculously op in terms
of civilisation building as it gets.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:13.920
You can take infinite stone we have made with
the Magu magu fruit to turn into nutritious

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:15.810
food for all the people.

00:14:15.810 --> 00:14:17.800
How crazy is that.

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:23.380
But even better, you could turn large chunks
of rock into vegetables and grains, and all

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:29.100
you have to do is take the seeds and plant
them all over the place to not only create

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:34.410
vegetation, but vegetation that can be turned
into food.

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:37.890
This is the fruit to start a flourishing economy.

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:43.180
And what better way to have people forget
their prejudices agains Fishman and co, if

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:47.620
there is enough space and food and wealth
for everyone.

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:48.620
Boom.

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:52.930
One Piece solved in 4 easy steps with less
than a dozen devil fruits.

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:57.840
As you can tell I'm in a devil fruit frenzy
at the moment, and if you are too and want

00:14:57.840 --> 00:15:03.550
to know why shanks actually stole the gomu
gomu no mi, I strongly recommend you watch

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:08.760
that video next.

